# Dev stack (this machine)

**Source of truth:** `backend-laravel/.env` only.

| Piece | Where |
|--------|--------|
| PHP | **8.4** → `C:\xampp\php\php.exe` (repo shortcut: `.tools/php84`) |
| API | `backend-laravel/` → `http://127.0.0.1:8000` |
| MySQL | **8.4.9** → `127.0.0.1:3306`, database `sabzine` (`DATABASE_URL` in `.env`) |
| MySQL files | `C:\xampp\mysql84\` (`my.ini`, `data/`, binaries) |
| Start DB | XAMPP Control Panel → **MySQL** (patched `C:\xampp\mysql_start.bat`) |

**Ignore / do not use:** `D:\mysql84` (removed), MariaDB `C:\xampp\mysql\bin\mysqld.exe`, old Node `backend/`, Docker defaults unless you chose Docker.

## Commands

```powershell
php -v                                    # must show 8.4.x
php backend-laravel\artisan serve --host=127.0.0.1 --port=8000
powershell -File tool/local-dev-stack.ps1 -Status
```

After empty database: `php artisan migrate --force`, `php artisan db:seed --class=FoodCatalogSeeder --force`, `php artisan db:seed --class=AiPromptsSeeder --force`, `php artisan sabzine:wire-ai`, `php tool/create-admin-once.php`.

